flowchart TD
    W[work] --> VIS{user-visible & ongoing now?}
    VIS -->|no| WM[WorkManager - deferrable, battery-respecting]
    VIS -->|yes| MUST{must run immediately?}
    MUST -->|yes, long + progress| WMF[WorkManager setForeground]
    MUST -->|yes, playback| MS[MediaSessionService]
    MUST -->|yes, tracking| FGS[FGS with correct type]
